{"ref":"character:divano-thelma","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Divano Thelma is a playable character from the base game version of Vampire Survivors that was introduced in Patch 0.6.1. Their starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Laurel.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:laurel"}," ",{"t":"Laurel","r":"weapon:laurel"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["23 May 2022 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Divano"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["FEBBRA"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Laurel.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:laurel"}," ",{"t":"Laurel","r":"weapon:laurel"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Obtain the ",{"t":"Crimson Shroud","r":"weapon:crimson-shroud"}]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 2,000"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[["No"]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Recovery","cells":[["1.00"]]},{"label":"Luck","cells":[["+30%"]]},{"label":"Greed","cells":[["-50%"]]},{"label":"Banish","cells":[["+10"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The player can unlock this character by obtaining the ",{"i":"Sprite-Crimson_Shroud.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:crimson-shroud"}," ",{"t":"Crimson Shroud","r":"weapon:crimson-shroud"},". They must then be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 2,000, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Divano can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"quandolodicelui\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Divano starts with 1 extra level, +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Pummarola.png","w":18,"h":15,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"},", +30% ",{"i":"Sprite-Clover.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},", -50% ",{"i":"Sprite-Stone_Mask.png","w":15,"h":12,"r":"powerup:greed"}," ",{"t":"Greed","r":"powerup:greed"},", and +10 ",{"i":"Sprite-Banish.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:banish"}," ",{"t":"Banish","r":"powerup:banish"},". They gain +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," every 5 levels up to level 25. The maximum amount of Armor gained this way is +5."]},{"k":"p","c":["The following table shows how much ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," they gain by level:"]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Levels"],"h":1},{"c":["Armor"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1-4"]},{"c":["0"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["5-9"]},{"c":["+1"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["10-14"]},{"c":["+2"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["15-19"]},{"c":["+3"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["20-24"]},{"c":["+4"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["25+"]},{"c":["+5"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Due to Divano's armor level bonus, they are a great users of the ",{"i":"Sprite-Divine_Bloodline_(IX).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:divine-bloodline-ix"}," ",{"t":"Divine Bloodline (IX)","r":"weapon:divine-bloodline-ix"}," arcana. Using weapons that specialize in retaliation damage, with the most important being ",{"i":"Sprite-Legionnaire.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:legionnaire"}," ",{"t":"Legionnaire","r":"weapon:legionnaire"},", along with the likes of ",{"i":"Sprite-NO_FUTURE.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:no-future"}," ",{"t":"NO FUTURE","r":"weapon:no-future"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Victory_Sword.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:victory-sword"}," ",{"t":"Victory Sword","r":"weapon:victory-sword"},", can allow Divano to achieve large amounts of maximum health and an enormous damage output. ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:armor-item"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"passive:armor-item"}," is a key pickup for this build."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Divano_Thelma.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Divano Thelma's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Divano_Thelma.gif","w":106,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 23 May 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Divano and ",{"i":"Sprite-Iguana_Gallo_Valletto.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:iguana-gallo-valletto"}," ",{"t":"Iguana Gallo Valletto","r":"character:iguana-gallo-valletto"}," are the only two non-secret characters to be left out of the dev log. Despite this, they are not secret characters because they have unlock requirements explained in-game as well as related achievements."]},{"c":["\"Divano\" means \"Sofa\" in Italian. But in this case, the reference is about the \"",{"t":"Divino Otelma","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Divino_Otelma"},"\", an Italian television personality."]},{"c":["Divano, ",{"i":"Sprite-Iguana_Gallo_Valletto.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:iguana-gallo-valletto"}," ",{"t":"Iguana Gallo Valletto","r":"character:iguana-gallo-valletto"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Christine_Davain.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:christine-davain"}," ",{"t":"Christine Davain","r":"character:christine-davain"}," are the only characters that start with an extra level."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["They all start with an extra level so that the player can pick up an extra weapon, either because their starting weapon does not deal damage, or in Christine's case, her weapon, the ",{"i":"Sprite-Pentagram.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:pentagram"}," ",{"t":"Pentagram","r":"weapon:pentagram"},", has a massive cooldown."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]}]}